Output demo.gif

Require go

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 42
Set Width 3600
Set Height 2000
Set Padding 64

Hide
Type "CALENDAR_DEMO=1 go run ."
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 2s
Type@20ms "jjjjjjjjjjj"
Sleep 1s
Type@20ms "kkkkkk"
Sleep 1s
Type@1s "llll"
Sleep 1s
Type@1s "hhhh"
Sleep 1s
Type "n"
Sleep 2s
Type@70ms "Calendar in your Terminal"
Sleep 4s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
